  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"counter-card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" role=\"status\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.counter-card {\n  background: #16213e;\n  border: 4px solid #e94560;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #0f3460, 8px 8px 0 #0f3460;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: #e94560;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  border: 2px solid #e94560;\n  line-height: 1;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border: 3px solid #e94560;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #f5f5f5;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #1a1a2e;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count++;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count--;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count of 0\n- Increase (+), decrease (−), and reset buttons\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with ARIA labels\n- Live region for screen reader announcements\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab and Enter/Space to interact.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – pixel theme\n- `script.js` – counter logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
